    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29007" root="عزم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَزْمِىٌّ</span></b>  A man <i>who fulfils his promise;</i> (K, TA;)
<i>who, when he promises a thing, performs it,</i> and
<i>fulfils it.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>A seller of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَزْم</span>, meaning <i>dregs of pressed raisins.</i> (K.)

